@HostAddress = http://localhost:5264

GET {{HostAddress}}/health/live
X-Correlation-ID: local-health-check

###

GET {{HostAddress}}/health/ready
X-Correlation-ID: local-readiness-check

###

GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/system/status
